{
  "name": "Other Malignant Neoplasms Europe",
  "remarks": [
    "European calibration of the malignant neoplasms not covered by a dedicated module.",
    "NEW in R4.",
    "",
    "R3 modelled only breast, prostate and colorectal cancer plus a little",
    "haematology (AML, multiple myeloma); lung cancer had a module that never ran.",
    "Those four solid-tumour sites are roughly 48% of European cancer incidence, so",
    "about half the oncological burden had no representation at all. Total cancer in",
    "R3 was 3.2% lifetime / 1.83% period against a European survivor prevalence of",
    "4-5%, and the site mix was heavily distorted.",
    "",
    "This module covers the thirteen next most common sites in one age- and",
    "sex-stratified hazard, so the burden lands in plausible people rather than",
    "requiring thirteen separate modules.",
    "",
    "Calibrated against: ECIS / IARC GLOBOCAN 2020-2022 Europe, ECDC Cancer Burden",
    "2022. Combined annual incidence for these sites is ~52% of all-cancer",
    "incidence, applied by age band:",
    "  25-39 0.026% | 40-49 0.094% | 50-59 0.234% | 60-69 0.494%",
    "  70-79 0.780% | 80+   0.936%",
    "Site shares are normalised European incidence shares within this set, given",
    "separately for women and men; uterus, ovary and cervix are female-only and",
    "their share is redistributed across the remaining sites for men.",
    "",
    "Known omission: brain and CNS tumours (~2% of incidence) are not included.",
    "SNOMED's generic brain concept (126952004) is 'Neoplasm of brain', which is not",
    "malignancy-specific, and no unambiguous malignant rollup was used here.",
    "",
    "All thirteen concept IDs verified against SNOMED CT International 20260801.",
    "Staging follows the European late-detection pattern (~55% stage III-IV)."
  ],
  "states": {
    "Initial": {
      "type": "Initial",
      "direct_transition": "Age_Guard"
    },
    "Age_Guard": {
      "type": "Guard",
      "allow": {
        "condition_type": "Age",
        "operator": ">=",
        "quantity": 25,
        "unit": "years"
      },
      "direct_transition": "Naive_Guard"
    },
    "Naive_Guard": {
      "type": "Guard",
      "allow": {
        "condition_type": "Attribute",
        "attribute": "other_cancer",
        "operator": "is nil"
      },
      "direct_transition": "Annual_Delay"
    },
    "Annual_Delay": {
